  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the International Comparison Program (ICP) in the Commonwealth of Independent States (CIS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to conduct the International Comparison Program (ICP) activities and produce purchasing power parities (PPPs) and related indices for the Commonwealth of Independent States (CIS) region. Through the conduct of the project activities, the project also aims at advancing the ICP as a permanent element of the regional and national statistical program, enhancing statistical capacity of the CIS National Statistical Offices (NSOs).</narrative>
  </description>
